            "type": "game",
            "name": "Undead",
            "steam_appid": 714050,
            "required_age": 0,
            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/714050/extras/ea2a8e6e583004da5339e1efd88def8d.avif?t=1551480196\" width=601 height=183 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Can you survive in this mystical world that conquered by Zombies? Pick your hero, upgrade your abilities, crush your enemies and zombies!</i><br><br><i>With ongoing game modes Undead is waiting for you!</i><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong><u>Deathmatch Game Mode;</u></strong><br></li><li>Players stands against zombies and other players. They try to survive with their pick of equipments and hero.<br>Game mode's length is 5 minutes. Players who stay alive until the timer is over rewarded with extra experience. Players gets 1 points for each kill of zombie or player and get their names written in the leaderboard! WHO WILL BE THE KING OF THE LEADERBOARD!<br><br></li><li><strong><u>Nexus Game Mode;</u></strong><br></li><li>Players start the game with 2 seperate teams and they have to protect their source of energy from enemy team and ZOMBIES!<br><br></li><li><strong><u>Fly or die - Team Deathmatch Game Mode;</u></strong><br></li><li>Player start the game with 2 seperate teams. Players try to survive against tough map concept without touching the ground and fighting with others. Game Mode's duration is 5 minutes.</li></ul></h2><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upcoming Game Modes;</h2></strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><i><u>Battle Royale Game Mode ;</u></i><br></li><li><i>Players try to survive with some of their picked equipments or with the equipments that they will loot from mysterious boxes all over the map! Only the one/s who survive till the end gets reward. WILL YOU BE THAT BRAVE TO STAY ALIVE TILL THE END?</i><br><br></li><li><i><u>Payload Game Mode ;</u></i><br></li><li><i>Players start the game with 2 seperate teams and they try to push the vehicle filled with load to their enemy base! <br>If you push payload within the time your team will be victorious. If no one can push the payload to enemy base within the time , team that stay close to the payload will lose the game! </i></li></ul>",
            "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/714050/extras/ea2a8e6e583004da5339e1efd88def8d.avif?t=1551480196\" width=601 height=183 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Can you survive in this mystical world that conquered by Zombies? Pick your hero, upgrade your abilities, crush your enemies and zombies!</i><br><br><i>With ongoing game modes Undead is waiting for you!</i><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong><u>Deathmatch Game Mode;</u></strong><br></li><li>Players stands against zombies and other players. They try to survive with their pick of equipments and hero.<br>Game mode's length is 5 minutes. Players who stay alive until the timer is over rewarded with extra experience. Players gets 1 points for each kill of zombie or player and get their names written in the leaderboard! WHO WILL BE THE KING OF THE LEADERBOARD!<br><br></li><li><strong><u>Nexus Game Mode;</u></strong><br></li><li>Players start the game with 2 seperate teams and they have to protect their source of energy from enemy team and ZOMBIES!<br><br></li><li><strong><u>Fly or die - Team Deathmatch Game Mode;</u></strong><br></li><li>Player start the game with 2 seperate teams. Players try to survive against tough map concept without touching the ground and fighting with others. Game Mode's duration is 5 minutes.</li></ul></h2><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upcoming Game Modes;</h2></strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><i><u>Battle Royale Game Mode ;</u></i><br></li><li><i>Players try to survive with some of their picked equipments or with the equipments that they will loot from mysterious boxes all over the map! Only the one/s who survive till the end gets reward. WILL YOU BE THAT BRAVE TO STAY ALIVE TILL THE END?</i><br><br></li><li><i><u>Payload Game Mode ;</u></i><br></li><li><i>Players start the game with 2 seperate teams and they try to push the vehicle filled with load to their enemy base! <br>If you push payload within the time your team will be victorious. If no one can push the payload to enemy base within the time , team that stay close to the payload will lose the game! </i></li></ul>",
